    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Score within-animal melanocyte conversion continuously across perturbations, fit the published signaling model to cohort incidence, and test its preregistered partial-conversion predictions against intervention outcomes.";
